    "title": "Literacy path — Wave 14",
    "description": "Fourteenth production literacy slice: kasra transfer from historical kaf onto ain, prepare medial nun, then decode inab. Compact two-unit wave. No new phonics rule, no new consonant, no sukun, damma, madd-yaa, madd-waw, hamza, sentences, or Wave 15.",
    "notProductionCurriculum": false
  },
